  "aboutMeBody": "Acquired broad knowledge of networking across L1 to L7 of the OSI model at KOSEN, with experience in campus network design and building a Tier 1 network for laboratory experiments. Later encountered Flutter and became immersed in app development. Currently working as a long-term intern, handling full-stack development for commercial applications operating in production. For graduation research, worked on applying Encryption-then-Compression (EtC) systems to H.264 (MPEG-4 AVC).",
